    // Normal/superior class bases with +3 or more to a skill tab (the [+3]/[+4]/[+5] bases): never hidden.
    {
      "comment": "R008 | Normal/superior class bases with +3 or more to a skill tab (the [+3]/[+4]/[+5] bases)… | never hide",
